    "https://upike.bamboohr.com/careers/533": {
      "title": "WS - Band Music Library Technician - FWS",
      "description": "WS - Band Music Library Technician - FWS. Department: FWS - Student Employment. Student Worker. Band Music Library Technician Division: Humanities Department: Music Experience: Entry-Level Supervisor of Student Employee(s): Dr. Kelly Taylor FWS, IWS, or Grant Funded: ☒ FWS, ☐ IWS, ☐ Grant Funded Avg. Hours/Week: ☐ 1-5, ☐ 6-10, ☒ 11-15, ☐ 16-20 Requested Start Date: --/--/-- Term of Position: ☐ Summer, ☒ Fall, ☒ Spring Band Music Library Technician Responsibilities and Career Competencies: Responsible for ongoing organization and cataloging of print and digital music library. — T, P, CT Maintains an online database of music, method books, textbooks, and other items in the music library. — T, P, CT Pulls, checks for parts, distributes, copies, and organizes music for ensemble rehearsals. — P, TW, CT Fulfills missing-part requests. — C, CT, P Collects, organizes, and refiles music after performances. — P, TW Notifies the director of issues with a given piece of music. — C, CT, P Works to update and improve the accuracy of the music library through the Band Library Audit & Preservation Initiative. — CT, T, P, CSD Transcribes missing parts, as needed, for POP literature. — CT, T, CSD Competencies/Skills: Communication (C), Teamwork (TW), Professionalism (P), Career & Self Development (CSD), Critical Thinking (CT), Community Transformation (CTR), Leadership (L), Technology (T) Qualifications: Enrolled in Band, Organized, Detail oriented can work well with hard deadlines. Communication skills. Spread sheet knowledge. Works independently. In the following sections check all boxes that apply to your job. Computer Skills: ☒ Word, ☒ Excel, ☐ PowerPoint, ☐ Canva, ☐ Social Media & New Technology, ☐ Other: _________________________ Other Skills: ☒ Attention to detail, ☒ Strong active listening abilities, ☐ Public speaking, ☒ Written & verbal communication, ☐ Customer focused, ☐ Willingness to learn new things Work Schedule: ☐ Su ___ to ___; ☐ M ___ to ___; ☐